+### D-147 · 2026-08-30 · First real smoke finalization fails closed; correct the feature-repair pairing invariant and reuse all immutable fits
+
+**Execution and stop:** the no-compute smoke preflight passed at exact clean commit `750266c7b8c4eb955b03f6081a861aed1051907b`: unit `d5baeb907ac3`, seeds 1000–1019, baseline/data/feature order, 60 physical sidecars, CPU, pinned environment, 10-GiB floor and independent C-volume canary/plan readback. The launcher then executed and independently synchronized all **60/60** sidecars—**140 member-model trainings**—without a timeout, retry or stale recovery. Final reopening refused before label publication: seed 1000 feature/model repair carried an `evaluation_pool_digest` different from baseline. The lease released normally. No `label_evidence.json`, count artifact, launch-complete report, exclusion comparison, reserve action or Experiment-1 fit was produced.
+
+**Root cause, checked on all twenty seeds before changing code:** `_digest_pool` deliberately hashes encoded `obs` and `next_obs` as well as action and episode. A feature repair removes `withheld_features=("shape",)` from the effective encoder, so its encoded observation pool must differ from baseline; the old synthetic fixtures incorrectly gave every arm one digest and made equality look universal. For every seed 1000–1019, baseline and data-repair full digests matched, feature-repair full digest differed, action/episode/step artifact digests matched across all three arms, and the persisted baseline scale matched. This is a consumer-invariant defect, not corrupt or unpaired fits.
+
+**Correction:** data repair and capacity repair still require the baseline's exact independently verified encoded-pool digest. Feature repair now fails closed if its encoded digest *equals* baseline, while every repair must match the complete action, episode and step inventories plus baseline scale. A new correction-only finalizer has no fitting, spawned-attempt, timeout, executor or recovery capability: from a clean later commit it revalidates the original preflight/environment, reloads all 60 sidecars against fit commit `750266c7…`, verifies/synchronizes each again, derives only the label and four Week-6 counts, and records both fit and finalizer commits under D-147. Ordinary launch validation remains exact-current-commit-only. No sidecar may be changed or rerun.
+
+**Verification/data:** corrected pairing/smoke matrix **78 passed, 1 expected Windows symlink skip**; correction-only finalizer/launch/label matrix **73 passed, 0 skipped**; final repository-wide D-147 suite **1,668 passed, 7 skipped, 0 failed in 1,445.85 s**. Syntax and diff hygiene pass. Correction implementation commit `7be59bd`; this local commit is a handoff artifact, not remote ancestry. **Data seen:** structural evidence and the fail-closed digest relation described above; no observed label, repair verdict, exclusion rate or hypothesis statistic was read. **Plan ref:** S§W6 Mon–Tue/Sat/Sun; D-033, D-034, D-055, D-061, D-140…D-146; DEV-011, DEV-017. **Reviewed by Sol:** not yet — delta 67.
